<title>FRANCE: G des Eaux did not buy Canal Plus stake.</title>
<headline>G des Eaux did not buy Canal Plus stake.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Generale des Eaux said that it was not the buyer of a 1.33 percent stake in Canal Plus traded on the Paris market this morning.</p>
<p>&quot;It was not Generale des Eaux,&quot; a company spokesman said, in reaction to share market speculation it had bought the shares to counter dilution of its Canal Plus stake following a planned merger with Nethold.</p>
</text>
